ubcc0\ud658]256PUTTZZLE_RAW_IMAGE_8.png", "id": "1174988316468342", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982474_1174988319801675_5356656402935387114_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=m2IvsDRVJc4Q7kNvwEvRElA&_nc_oc=AdpEkiBJ48mJ8M1XRX_sNOWXRXA6E1k-K45g9lfpMh2_xdZFV6vuCpFmgm40jxTouao&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRcUemqAC2GlXLq9Razflxd6WNc-IKnKm8Be0u8zJGJeQ&oe=6AEC8D5C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "\ucea1\ucc98_2022_10_28_17_08_12_390.png", "id": "665571025131462", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75222944_665571028464795_3967012109877024291_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=e3xEU5kH-LsQ7kNvwGSkZLR&_nc_oc=AdqlL8Ob525zhZCNk3MUMLy9YFI9ME7_moIaHj021YmGlJTfBmbzhyNmKPI3MBTsVl0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRNvFZmEVMuPD907YnmTEIWYdk2mCfRslu1e3joWzDXTA&oe=6AECA32A"}, "display_name": "PUTTZZLE", "keywords": [], "long_description": "You have only one objective in this game:  Putt your ball into the hole. \nIn order to do so, you will be given two items in this game: a hammer and a heavy ball.\n\nJust putt the ball into the hole to complete each stage. \n-Try to avoid various terrain and obstacles.\n-Try using any method to complete the stage with the number of given opportunities.\n \n[Intuitive controls]\nPUTTZZLE is simple. Just putt the ball into the hole by any means. \n\n[Entertainment from simplicity]\nJust focus on putting the ball into the target.\nCalculate the number of cases to solve each stage. \n\n[Increasing difficulty level]\n[PUTTZLE] is like a puzzle. You will experience more complicated stages as you finish each stage with even more obstacles. \nYou can even utilize obstacles or avoid them to finish the stage.", "short_description": "PUTT YOUR BALL IN IT! "}]}, "developer_name": "Pixelity Gamelab", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://pixelitygames.com/privacy-poli